      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Enemies are hostile targets you will encounter throughout the world. They
    vary in strength, abilities, and behaviour depending on the area, and will engage
    you in combat on sight or when provoked (agression type is listed in the top
    right of every combat map).\n\nEach enemy also has a combat profile, which defines
    its primary combat proficiency. \n\nDefeating enemies will reward gold, combat
    experience, and loot. As you advance, enemies become more dangerous and may require
    different strategies to overcome."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
