      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Elite Enemies are stronger versions of regular enemies that provide a
    greater challenge and more rewarding loot. They have twice the health of their
    normal counterparts.


    Defeating an Elite Enemy rewards 2x Gold and 2x Combat
    Experience, while also applying a 5x multiplier to the base chance of loot dropped
    from its normal variant. In addition, some Elite Enemies have access to exclusive
    drops that cannot be obtained from their standard counterparts.


    Elite Enemies
    have a chance to appear while fighting on any non-boss map, with their spawn
    rate varying depending on the area. '
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
